тися, працювати, отримувати потрібні послуги та бути активними учасниками життя громади."},{"t":1794398866,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25378","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (11.11/14:07)"},{"t":1794390863,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25373","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (11.11/11:54)"},{"t":1794386059,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25370","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (11.11/10:34)"},{"t":1794382994,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25367","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (11.11/09:43)"},{"t":1794382850,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25366","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (11.11/09:40)"},{"t":1794381250,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25363","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (11.11/09:13)"},{"t":1794380405,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25362","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (11.11/08:59)"},{"t":1794373926,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25358","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (11.11/07:11)"},{"t":1794356942,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25352","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (11.11/ 02:28)"},{"t":1794353478,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25350","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (11.11/01:31)"},{"t":1794350459,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25345","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (11.11/00:40)"},{"t":1794347013,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25343","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (10.11/23:43)"},{"t":1794345136,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/25341","kind":"close","type":null,"places":"[]","text":"🟢ВІДБІЙ (10.11/23:12)"},{"t":1794344659,"src":"TAB","link":"https://t.me/cherkaskaODA/